1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:05,000
Autonomous vehicles must remain safe during persistent perception degradation.

2
00:00:05,000 --> 00:00:10,000
ChronoSafe-Drive creates a complete perception-to-control safety loop.

3
00:00:10,000 --> 00:00:16,500
Eight-frame causal evidence combines camera, LiDAR, motion, and timing.

4
00:00:16,500 --> 00:00:23,000
A factorized GRU diagnoses each modality while predicting continuous risk.

5
00:00:23,000 --> 00:00:30,000
Stress conformal calibration drives NORMAL, DEGRADED, and MINIMAL_RISK control.

6
00:00:30,000 --> 00:00:36,500
Training combines MetaDrive physics simulation with public nuScenes streams.

7
00:00:36,500 --> 00:00:43,000
Timing metadata is treated as a fallible sensor input.

8
00:00:43,000 --> 00:00:50,000
Complete log-based splits prevent adjacent-drive data leakage.

9
00:00:50,000 --> 00:00:56,500
This is the actual AMD cloud project workspace.

10
00:00:56,500 --> 00:01:03,000
PyTorch identifies the Radeon GPU through ROCm and HIP.

11
00:01:03,000 --> 00:01:10,000
The verifier passes 118 checks against frozen evidence.

12
00:01:10,000 --> 00:01:17,500
This validated-Xvfb dashboard replays committed evidence from unseen seed 149.

13
00:01:17,500 --> 00:01:25,000
The risk threshold was frozen before every external test.

14
00:01:25,000 --> 00:01:32,500
Persistent compound degradation raises the calibrated risk upper bound.

15
00:01:32,500 --> 00:01:40,000
The controller slows down, enters MINIMAL_RISK, and reaches a near-stop.

16
00:01:40,000 --> 00:01:46,500
All 20 frozen external seeds reach minimal risk.

17
00:01:46,500 --> 00:01:53,000
Premature triggers remain zero; diagnosis accuracy is 97.07 percent.

18
00:01:53,000 --> 00:02:00,000
Upper-risk coverage is 99.83 percent; final speed is near zero.

19
00:02:00,000 --> 00:02:06,500
Robust training gains 11 to 27 points under timestamp corruption.

20
00:02:06,500 --> 00:02:13,000
Largest gains occur for swapped channels and spoofed-clean metadata.

21
00:02:13,000 --> 00:02:20,000
Intact accuracy remains 99.34 percent.

22
00:02:20,000 --> 00:02:30,000
Training and inference run on AMD Radeon gfx1100 with ROCm 7.2.

23
00:02:30,000 --> 00:02:40,000
Batch-one latency is 0.559 milliseconds; batch-1024 throughput reaches 1.37 million sequences per second.

24
00:02:40,000 --> 00:02:50,000
AMP preserves every diagnosis across 8,192 real sequences.

25
00:02:50,000 --> 00:02:55,000
Multimodal diagnosis, calibrated risk, and closed-loop control.

26
00:02:55,000 --> 00:03:00,000
Diagnose early, calibrate uncertainty, and stop safely.
